# Architecture — Flux de données villes prioritaires

```plantuml
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFBF5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7

title Flux de données : Villes优先 dans l'autocomplete

actor User as U
participant "CityAutocomplete\n(RHF Controller)" as CA
participant "useDeliveryCities\n(hook)" as HK
participant "/api/delivery-cities/search\n(GET)" as API
participant "searchDeliveryCities()\n(queries)" as QRY
participant "delivery_cities\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "DeliveryCitiesEditor\n(Admin)" as ADM
participant "/api/admin/delivery-cities/positions\n(PATCH)" as ADM_API

== Consultation (query vide) ==

U -> CA : Focus sur le champ ville
CA -> HK : useDeliveryCities("")
HK -> API : GET /api/delivery-cities/search?q=&limit=8
API -> QRY : searchDeliveryCities("", {limit:8})
QRY -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE active AND country='MA'\n  ORDER BY position ASC, name_fr ASC\n  LIMIT 8
DB --> QRY : [Casablanca(pos:1), Marrakech(pos:2), ...]
QRY --> API : DeliveryCity[]
API --> HK : {items: PublicCity[], total, query}
HK --> CA : {items, loading:false}
CA --> U : 🔍 "Villes populaires"\n  1. Casablanca\n  2. Marrakech\n  ...

== Consultation (query "cas") ==

U -> CA : Tape "cas"
CA -> HK : useDeliveryCities("cas")
HK -> API : GET /api/delivery-cities/search?q=cas&limit=8
API -> QRY : searchDeliveryCities("cas", {limit:8})
QRY -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE active AND country='MA'\n  AND name_fr ILIKE '%cas%'\n  ORDER BY position ASC, name_fr ASC\n  LIMIT 32
DB --> QRY : [Casablanca(pos:1), ...]
QRY -> QRY : postFilterAndRank() → rank 0 (prefix)
QRY --> API : [Casablanca]
API --> HK : {items: [Casablanca]}
HK --> CA : {items}
CA --> U : 🔍 Casablanca — 0 MAD — 24h

== Admin : gestion des positions ==

ADM -> ADM_API : PATCH /positions\n[{slug:"casablanca", position:1}, ...]
ADM_API -> QRY : updateDeliveryCityPositions(patches)
QRY -> DB : UPDATE delivery_cities SET position=X, updated_at=NOW() WHERE slug=Y
DB --> QRY : OK
QRY --> ADM_API : {updated: 13}
ADM_API --> ADM : 200 {updated: 13}
ADM -> ADM : Refetch & re-render

@enduml
```

## Diagramme de séquence : Admin UI

```plantuml
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFBF5

title Admin : Panneau Villes优先

actor Admin as A
participant "DeliveryCitiesEditor" as ED
participant "PriorityCitiesPanel" as PR
participant "PATCH /positions" as API
participant "delivery_cities" as DB

A -> ED : Clique onglet « Villes优先 »
ED -> PR : Affiche liste des villes avec position > 0
PR -> PR : Chargement initial depuis /api/admin/delivery-cities?sort=position&active=true

== Réordonner (drag & drop) ==

A -> PR : Drag "Marrakech" avant "Casablanca"
PR -> PR : Met à jour l'ordre local (optimistic)
PR -> API : PATCH /positions [{slug:"marrakech",position:1},{slug:"casablanca",position:2},...]
API -> DB : UPDATE delivery_cities SET position=1 WHERE slug='marrakech' ...
DB --> API : OK
API --> PR : {updated: 13}
PR -> PR : Re-fetch liste mise à jour

== Ajouter une ville à la priorité ==

A -> PR : Clique « + Ajouter une ville »
PR -> PR : Ouvre un mini-autocomplete (recherche dans les villes actives)
A -> PR : Sélectionne "Oujda"
PR -> API : PATCH /positions [{slug:"oujda",position:14}, ...]
API -> DB : UPDATE delivery_cities SET position=14 WHERE slug='oujda'
DB --> API : OK
API --> PR : {updated: 1}
PR -> PR : Ajoute Oujda à la liste优先

== Retirer une ville de la priorité ==

A -> PR : Clique « ✕ » sur "Tanger"
PR -> API : PATCH /admin/delivery-cities/tanger {position: 0}
API -> DB : UPDATE delivery_cities SET position=0 WHERE slug='tanger'
DB --> API : OK
API --> PR : OK
PR -> PR : Retire Tanger de la liste优先

@enduml
```

## Diagramme ER — Table delivery_cities (colonnes pertinentes)

```plantuml
@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFBF5

entity "delivery_cities" as DC {
  * id : text PK
  --
  * slug : text UNIQUE
  * name_fr : text NOT NULL
  name_ar : text
  * country_code : text DEFAULT 'MA'
  * delivery_price_mad : integer NOT NULL
  * delivery_eta : text NOT NULL
  * is_active : boolean DEFAULT true
  * source : text DEFAULT 'sendit'
  external_ref : text
  * aliases : jsonb DEFAULT '[]'
  * metadata : jsonb DEFAULT '{}'
  ** position : integer DEFAULT 0 **
  * created_at : timestamptz DEFAULT now()
  * updated_at : timestamptz DEFAULT now()
  created_by : text
  updated_by : text
  --
  == Indexes ==
  delivery_cities_slug_unique (slug)
  delivery_cities_active_name_idx (is_active, name_fr)
  delivery_cities_country_active_idx (country_code, is_active)
}

note right of DC
  **position** détermine l'ordre d'affichage
  dans l'autocomplete (query vide).

  position = 0 → ville non优先 (tri alpha)
  position > 0 → ville优先 (tri par position ASC)

  Les villes优先 apparaissent en tête
  avant les villes non优先.
end note

@enduml
```